    <div class="drawer-sec">
      <button class="drawer-item" data-act="export"><span>导出备份</span><small>保存为 JSON 文件</small></button>
      <button class="drawer-item" data-act="import"><span>导入备份</span><small>从 JSON 文件恢复</small></button>
      <button class="drawer-item" data-act="import-text"><span>粘贴文字导入</span><small>把 AI 整理好的菜谱贴进来</small></button>
